  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1780677226_9888628_8d0d546ef193b5a5ee58420ee28fd84f.jpg",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\"><div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\"><div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling\"><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">About our brand and products:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><br>We are a contemporary men's fashion brand focused on delivering modern, trend-led clothing without compromising on sustainability. Our collections combine premium quality, versatile styling, and the latest fashion trends to help men build a wardrobe that looks good and feels good.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>What makes us different:</strong><br>We are committed to a 100% sustainability promise. From premium organic and recycled fabrics to eco-friendly packaging and responsible sourcing, sustainability is at the heart of everything we do. We believe fashion should be stylish, high quality, and better for the planet.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>How affiliates can earn:</strong><br>Affiliates earn 8% commission on a customer's first order and 5% lifetime commission on all future purchases made by referred customers. This allows you to benefit not only from initial sales but also from repeat purchases over the long term.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>How to promote us:</strong><br>Promote our products through social media, Instagram Reels, TikTok videos, YouTube content, blogs, email newsletters, fashion reviews, styling guides, outfit inspiration posts, and sustainable fashion recommendations. Authentic content showcasing our products and brand values tends to perform best.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>Other information:</strong></span></p><ul><li style=\"font-size:14px;\">Premium men's contemporary fashion brand</li><li style=\"font-size:14px;\">Sustainable and ethically focused production</li><li style=\"font-size:14px;\">Organic and recycled materials used throughout our collections</li><li style=\"font-size:14px;\">Eco-friendly packaging</li><li style=\"font-size:14px;\">Regular new arrivals and trend-focused collections</li><li style=\"font-size:14px;\">Attractive commission structure with lifetime earnings potential</li><li style=\"font-size:14px;\">Ideal partnership for fashion, lifestyle, men's style, and sustainability-focused creators and publishers.</li></ul></div></div></div></div><div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"pointer-events-none -mb-px h-px w-full opacity-0\"><br></div></div></div>",
